# Toggle / 开关组件规范

Shared toggle: `control: 'toggle'` rendered as `.os-fld-row` + `.os-tg` in `online-store/js/app.js`.

When the user names toggle / 开关 / Show … 开关 for a layout change, update this shared control so every caller gets the change. Do not patch one field only.

## Layout (match Shopify theme editor)

- Label and toggle stay on the **same row**
- Label text stays **single-line** (no wrap). Use ellipsis if the panel is too narrow
- Optional `info` / hint may wrap on the row below the label+toggle
- Do not use `.os-fld-stack` for toggles (that layout is for text / Heading / Content inputs)

## Contrast with text inputs

- Text / URL / richtext / textarea: label row + control on the next row (`.os-fld-stack`)
- Toggle: label + switch on one row (`.os-fld-row`)
